{"id":"00067","root":"uni00067_1","name":{"ja":"水城　不知火","en":"Mizuki Shiranui"},"title":{"ja":"【妖艶舞踏】","en":"【Bewitching Dancer】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【妖艶舞踏】 水城　不知火","en":"【Bewitching Dancer】 Mizuki Shiranui"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-11-02","limited":true,"characterId":5,"profile":{"ja":"ゆきかぜの母親。対魔忍不知火として勇名をはせていたが、５年前にある任務中に行方不明に。夫は彼女が行方不明になってから４年後に任務中に死亡している。対魔忍の隊長を務めるアサギの良きサポート役として戦闘能力だけでなく知略に長けゆきかぜにとって憧れの母親であった。  ","en":"Mizuki Shiranui is Mizuki Yukikaze's mother. Once a renowned Taimanin known as \"Shiranui,\" she vanished during a mission five years ago. Her husband died on a mission four years after her disappearance. As a trusted support to Captain Igawa Asagi, she excelled not only in combat but also in strategy, becoming the mother Mizuki Yukikaze has always admired."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"ももぞの薫","forms":[{"id":"uni00067_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[139,278],"def":[112,224],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","40008"]},{"id":"uni00067_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[213,426],"def":[159,318],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","40008","40009"]},{"id":"uni00067_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2018,4036],"sp":[350,350],"atk":[292,584],"def":[211,422],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","40008","40009","40010"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Devilish damage"}]},"40008":{"slot":"skill1","id":40008,"name":{"ja":"槍術-閃光"},"hits":1,"cutin":fal