_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"矢崎、あいつだけは許さない……絶対にこの手で倒すわ","en":"Yazaki, I will never forgive that one… I'll definitely bring them down with my own hands."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"ご、ごめんなさい、あなたがあの人に、あんまり似てるから……","en":"I-I'm sorry, you look so much like that person…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"五年も帰らないで、ゆきかぜ……許してくれるかしら……","en":"Five years away, Yukikaze… will you ever forgive me?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"う、くっ……、体が熱いの……お願い、あなた……静めてくれない？","en":"Ugh… my body's burning… please, you… could you calm me down?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"どんなに辱められても忘れないわ、あの人と、ゆきかぜを……！","en":"No matter how much I'm humiliated, I won't forget that person and Yukikaze…!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067_1/uni00067_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00067